    <question no="20" id="PRB-AA2473F496C0FF55-Q20" type="긍정형(옳은/적절한 것 고르기)" category="핵심 개념·이론 이해형">
      <stem>$X$는 송신기에서 전송되는 값이며, $N$은 전송 채널에서 발생하는 가산성 잡음이다. 이때, $X$와 $N$은 서로 독립이며, 각각 $- 1 \leq X \leq 1$, $- 1 \leq N \leq 1$의 범위에서 균일 확률밀도함수(uniform probability density function)를 갖는 연속랜덤변수이다. 수신기에서 수신되는 신호가 $Y = X + N$일 때, $Y$의 확률밀도함수는?</stem>
      <formulas count="12">
        <formula area="질문">X</formula>
        <formula area="질문">N</formula>
        <formula area="질문">X</formula>
        <formula area="질문">N</formula>
        <formula area="질문">- 1 \leq X \leq 1</formula>
        <formula area="질문">- 1 \leq N \leq 1</formula>
        <formula area="질문">Y = X + N</formula>
        <formula area="질문">Y</formula>
        <formula area="선택지①">f_{Y} ( y ) = {cases {( 1 + y ) / 2 , for - 1 &lt; y \leq 0 &amp; # eqalign {( 1 - y ) / 2 , for 0 &lt; y \leq 1 # 0 , otherwise} &amp;}}</formula>
        <formula area="선택지②">f_{Y} ( y ) = {cases {( 2 + y ) / 2 , for - 2 &lt; y \leq 0 &amp; # eqalign {( 2 - y ) / 2 , for 0 &lt; y \leq 2 # 0 , otherwise} &amp;}}</formula>
        <formula area="선택지③">f_{Y} ( y ) = {cases {( 1 + y ) / 4 , for - 1 &lt; y \leq 0 &amp; # eqalign {( 1 - y ) / 4 , for 0 &lt; y \leq 1 # 0 , otherwise} &amp;}}</formula>
        <formula area="선택지④">f_{Y} ( y ) = {cases {( 2 + y ) / 4 , for - 2 &lt; y \leq 0 &amp; # eqalign {( 2 - y ) / 4 , for 0 &lt; y \leq 2 # 0 , otherwise} &amp;}}</formula>
      </formulas>
      <choices count="4">
        <choice no="1" is_answer="false">$f_{Y} ( y ) = {\left\{\begin{array}{ll}( 1 + y ) / 2 , for - 1 &lt; y \leq 0 &amp; \\ \begin{aligned}( 1 - y ) / 2 , for 0 &lt; y \leq 1 \\ 0 , otherwise\end{aligned} &amp;\end{array}\right.}$</choice>
        <choice no="2" is_answer="false">$f_{Y} ( y ) = {\left\{\begin{array}{ll}( 2 + y ) / 2 , for - 2 &lt; y \leq 0 &amp; \\ \begin{aligned}( 2 - y ) / 2 , for 0 &lt; y \leq 2 \\ 0 , otherwise\end{aligned} &amp;\end{array}\right.}$</choice>
        <choice no="3" is_answer="false">$f_{Y} ( y ) = {\left\{\begin{array}{ll}( 1 + y ) / 4 , for - 1 &lt; y \leq 0 &amp; \\ \begin{aligned}( 1 - y ) / 4 , for 0 &lt; y \leq 1 \\ 0 , otherwise\end{aligned} &amp;\end{array}\right.}$</choice>
        <choice no="4" is_answer="true">$f_{Y} ( y ) = {\left\{\begin{array}{ll}( 2 + y ) / 4 , for - 2 &lt; y \leq 0 &amp; \\ \begin{aligned}( 2 - y ) / 4 , for 0 &lt; y \leq 2 \\ 0 , otherwise\end{aligned} &amp;\end{array}\right.}$</choice>
      </choices>
      <answer source="정답표 (책형교차대조: 일치)" cross_check="일치">4</answer>
